  "notes": "Ludonimbus's own list (MIT). Keys are the game's save data names, hashed with Murmur3. Hearts are counted in quarters (4 per heart). No achievement for beating Ganon yet: the original game doesn't save after the ending, so it needs checking against a finished save first.",
